<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31614" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏb-ĕquĭto</span></b> ,
			āvi, 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. n., to ride towards, ride up to</i>
			(not ante-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b>
			With <i>dat.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">obequitando castris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 2,
					45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">portis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 54</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">29, 34</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">moenibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					8, 10, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">peditibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					10, 9, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agmini,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					3, 10, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ordinibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 24, 1, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			With <i>acc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">obequitans moenia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 24, 2, 9</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(g).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insolentissime,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 3, 2, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">voces obequitantis acceptae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					4, 2, 50</span></i>
			. —* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non obequitabit nec illis vibrantibus
					concitatisque sententiis velut missilibus utetur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 12, 9, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
